<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n96415" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στεῖρα</span></b>  (A), ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στερεός</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>forepart of a ship's keel</i>, continued into the
			<i>stem</i> or <i>cutwater</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμφὶ δὲ κῦμα στείρῃ πορφύρεον μεγάλ᾽
					ἴαχε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					1.482
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				2.428
			</span></i>: cf. 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στείρωμα, στερέωμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					3
				</span></i>
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στήριγμα </span>(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">στείρη</span> only in <i><span class="en">
				<u>An.Ox.</u>
				3.396
			</span></i>). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> a kind of
				<i>bandage</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Heliod.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				48.20.12
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				f.l. for
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σπεῖρα</span>
			 in <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.31
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
